# people/

Per-person markdown files. Domain actors — clients, collaborators, counterparties, suppliers, advisors.

Schema per FRAMEWORK.md Section 4.4:
- Frontmatter: type: person, role: (their role in this domain), date: YYYY-MM-DD
- Body: who they are, what they do, relevant history, wikilinks to related decisions and projects

**Scope boundary:** people who recur across EVERY hub the user builds (family, long-term partners) live in `~/thehub/USER.md` People section, NOT here. This folder is for people specific to this hub's domain. Test: "Will this person still matter in a completely different hub I build?" If yes, USER.md. If no, here.
